
Revert Cachy mods, plus improve smoothness

(1) Set scheduler tunable latencies to unscaled
(2) Compute sched_base_slice
(3) Decrease timer_slack_ns default
(4) Disable sched/fair DELAY_DEQUEUE feature
(5) Restrict NI_RANDOM throttling to !SD_SHARE_LLC domains

Signed-off-by: Mario Roy <>

